    the corollary's re-entry condition in the conclusion; Table 24 with 4-decimal scores and the deciding efficiency (TDD).
    Lesson: expected test numbers pasted from a command. Gate ok; clean build.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

